Spec: History

Purpose:
  History tab: a filtered, sorted, day-grouped list of ride cards with cached previews, search, filters,
    selection and batch delete, ride detail, edit, and the route comparison of followed rides.

Owns:
  ./*.dart
  ./widgets/*.dart
  /test/history

References:
  /docs/specs/history/13-history.md
  /docs/specs/history/20-followed-rides.md
  /lib/map/map.sdd

Must:
  Sort by date groups by day, newest day first; distance and top speed sort descending; duration ascending.
  The year, month range, activities, favourites and search filters combine; at All years a month range means
    those months in every year.
  The filter badge counts every deviation from the default except the search.
  Filters apply live; there is no Apply step.
  Search matches the display title or the comment, trimmed and case-insensitive.
  Stats come from the values stored with the ride, never from trackpoints at list time.
  Cards show the cached preview, never a live map.
  A target ride from Home is scrolled to and highlighted for `1.5` s, resetting filters that hide it.
  Long-press starts selection; back while selecting clears it.
  Deleting evicts the preview; deletes confirm with ICU plurals.
  Route chips open the comparison sheet; the followed-routes filter is shown once a route was followed.
  An empty filter result says so instead of showing the empty history.
